This is an interview with the driver who finished the battle in the French Grand Prix.

05:45:50.500 --> 05:45:53.120
It was a bit tough.

05:45:53.120 --> 05:45:55.120
I went straight with the brakes.

05:45:55.120 --> 05:45:58.600
Because of that, my pace didn't go up.

05:45:58.600 --> 05:46:00.000
And the tires went up and down.

05:46:00.000 --> 05:46:30.000
it's fantastic result for us you know a lot of people might not think fourth is is great a great finish but it for us it is at the moment and to get those points and to fight so hard for them it's it's a great day for us yeah it's been disappointing really what happened on Friday it really destroyed our weekend completely

05:46:30.000 --> 05:46:36.950
Absolutely, on the view that we wanted to win here, but, okay, second place is quite good

05:46:36.950 --> 05:46:37.950
for us.

05:46:37.950 --> 05:46:43.350
We only dropped two points, so it didn't cost too much, but of course I want to win the race.

05:46:43.350 --> 05:46:46.520
Yeah, it was really, really good.

05:46:46.520 --> 05:46:50.620
The car performed extremely well again in the race.

05:46:50.620 --> 05:46:57.300
I think Barcelona and here in Manicuz, you see all the supporters, all the blue grand

05:46:57.300 --> 05:46:58.300
stands.

05:46:58.300 --> 05:47:00.000
I think it's an extra motivation.

05:47:00.000 --> 05:47:05.890
We did two good races in Barcelona and here, but obviously better to win.

05:47:39.240 --> 05:47:40.240
You know it's true.

